Data types
   these specifies the type, size, and range of data that var can store.
types-
constant   1) integer -  deci(30) , octa(056) , hexa(0x54),..
           2) char -  'a' , '3' , 'D' , '&' ,...
           3) float - 4.3, 1.9,...
           4) double - 5.3f, 2.6s,...
           5) string(not type) - "hello" , "shahs",...
